  "text": "Before I get to 2026, two housekeeping items. First, beginning this year we will no longer provide quarterly EPS guidance; we will give annual guidance and update it every quarter. This is a change in practice, not a signal about the year. Second, we are retiring the 2027 adjusted operating margin target of 20% that we set at our 2023 investor day. We delivered 20.4% in 2025, two years early, and we are replacing it with a 2028 target of 22% to 23%."
